### 1. Creare carte
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software"
}


### 2. Verificare status procesare asincrona
GET http://localhost:8080/books/status/<126ea9d1-f148-4a49-aaf3-2188b63b6373>

### 3. Listare toate cartile
GET http://localhost:8080/books

### 4. Afisare carte dupa ID
GET http://localhost:8080/books/1

### 5. Creare carte
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Amintiri din copilarie",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Ion",
      "surname": "Creanga"
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Creeare carte mai vasta
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Carte cu Structura",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Mihai",
      "surname": "Eminescu"
    }
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "title": "Capitolul 1"
    }
  ]
}


### 7. Creare carte completa
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Erich",
      "surname": "Gamma"
    },
    {
      "name": "Richard",
      "surname": "Helm"
    }
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Introducere in sabloane."
    }
  ]
}

### -. Creare carte completa de elemente
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Erich",
      "surname": "Gamma"
    },
    {
      "name": "Richard",
      "surname": "Helm"
    }
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Acesta este un paragraf introductiv salvat direct in carte."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_proxy",
      "url": "https://example.com/diagrama-clase.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "attributes": "border=1;rows=5;cols=3"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Capitolul 1: Sabloane Creationale",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Paragraf imbricat in interiorul primei sectiuni."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}